@startuml FRQ-PIP-17.1-feed-records
' Gledište: jedan RSS dokument od izvora do zapisa na dokumentu. Publika: analitičar,
' implementator. Pogled, ne izvor istine (D-13). Labele: UK English.
title FRQ-PIP-17.1 — Reading a feed into records

|Configuration|
start
:Target format named;
if (Known file type? (BR-08)) then (no)
  :Pipeline is not built;
  stop
else (yes)
endif

|A1 pass|
:Hand over one document;

|Reading|
:Parse with entity-expansion limits (BR-07);
if (Well-formed, RSS root, has a channel?) then (no)
  :Report, skip (BR-06);
  stop
else (yes)
endif
:Channel and items to flat records\n(standard fields, Dublin Core aliases — BR-03);
:Dates to ISO 8601, unreadable kept (BR-04),\nrepeated elements joined (BR-05);
if (Any items?) then (no)
  :Warn, skip;
  stop
else (yes)
endif

|Hand-over|
if (Target format is RSS?) then (yes)
  :Feed with its channel;
else (no)
  :Items as records;
endif
:Records and format onto the document;
:Publish to the blackboard;
stop
@enduml
